{"t_ms": 434671, "conversation_id": "v2llm_streaming_retrieve_s015", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Taxi & Local Transport Booking\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Concierge Desk can arrange taxis, airport transfers, car rentals, and local sightseeing transportation. Guests are encouraged to book transportation in advance during weekends and holidays. Fare estimates will be provided before confirming the reservation, and payment can be made directly to the service provider or added to the room bill where applicable.", "Parking Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nOn-site parking is available for hotel guests at a charge of \u20b9200 per vehicle per day. Parking spaces are allocated on a first-come, first-served basis and cannot be reserved in advance. Guests are requested to lock their vehicles and avoid leaving valuable belongings inside parked cars.", "Airport Pickup & Drop Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nAirport transportation is available for guests upon prior reservation. Pick-up and drop-off services operate throughout the day and are charged according to the vehicle selected. Guests should provide their flight details at least 24 hours before arrival to ensure timely service. Hotel representatives will coordinate the pickup schedule and assist guests upon arrival."], "scores": [0.5050066113471985, 0.7341262102127075, 0.7619493007659912], "filenames": ["49_taxi_booking.txt", "60_parking_v2.txt", "07_airport_transfer.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 110, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
